From: Asdlerto Korry <korryasdlerto@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: m52xq NFC and speakerphone quick settings

Samsung Galaxy M52 5G (m52xq), Debian Phosh в6:
- m52xq-nfc-quick-setting: NFC on/off through /dev/rfkill (uaccess ACL of the active user), state from the
  rfkill events (no polling);
- m52xq-speakerphone-quick-setting: the "Speakerphone" app as a tile: runs /usr/local/bin/m52xq-speakerphone,
  shows the route written by m52xq-audio-route to $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/m52xq-audio-route, highlighted during a
  Telegram call ($XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/m52xq-voip-active); inotify, no polling.
---
